| Period        |   Product SK | Product Name                |   Revision ID | MRP (₹)   | Effective Selling Price (₹)   | Valid From   | Valid To   | Avg Printed Price (₹)   |   Units Sold | Catalog Revenue (₹)   |
+===============+==============+=============================+===============+===========+===============================+==============+============+=========================+==============+=======================+
| March 2024    |         1008 | Britannia Cream Biscuit 60g |        500029 | ₹74.98    | ₹66.95                        | 2022-01-01   | 2024-06-19 | ₹66.86                  |          111 | ₹7,431.45             |
+---------------+--------------+-----------------------------+---------------+-----------+-------------------------------+--------------+------------+-------------------------+--------------+-----------------------+
| December 2024 |         1008 | Britannia Cream Biscuit 60g |        500032 | ₹77.20    | ₹68.93                        | 2024-08-08   | 9999-12-31 | ₹68.93                  |           84 | ₹5,790.12             |
+---------------+--------------+-----------------------------+---------------+-----------+-------------------------------+--------------+------------+-------------------------+--------------+-----------------------+

FINDINGS:
  * In March 2024, Britannia Cream Biscuit 60g sold at Revision 500029: MRP ₹74.98, Selling Price ₹66.95
  * In December 2024, the same biscuit sold at Revision 500032: MRP ₹77.20, Selling Price ₹68.93
  * Zero code was changed between the two query invocations.
  * If the category manager had answered from today's shelf price (Rev 500032), they would have reported ₹68.93 instead of the true March price ₹66.95.
