[Step 6/7] Running Task E: Cross-System Zero-Copy Query & Engine Evidence...

================================================================================
TASK E: ZERO-COPY FEDERATED QUERY & EXECUTION PLAN EVIDENCE
================================================================================
CROSS-SYSTEM FEDERATED SQL QUERY:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SELECT 
            st.region,
            st.city,
            st.store_name,
            c.category_name,
            ROUND(SUM(s.line_revenue), 2) AS category_revenue,
            ROUND(SUM(s.qty), 0) AS units_sold
        FROM read_parquet('s3://annapurna-sales/fact_sales/*/*/*.parquet', hive_partitioning=true) s
        JOIN pg.stores st ON s.store_id = st.store_id
        JOIN pg.products p 
            ON s.product_code = p.product_code 
           AND CAST(s.business_date AS DATE) BETWEEN p.valid_from AND p.valid_to
        JOIN pg.product_categories c ON p.category_id = c.category_id
        WHERE s.year_month = '2024-10' AND st.region = 'South'
        GROUP BY 1, 2, 3, 4
        ORDER BY category_revenue DESC
        LIMIT 10;
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

